'''Jingle Cat Bell''' (なんとクリスマスが来た！, ''Nanto Kurisumasu ga Kita!'', '''What a Christmas Has Come!''') is the December event of [[The Battle Cats]]. It was added in [[Version 2.0 Update#Version 2.0.9 Update|Version 2.0.9]].

==Event Information==
{{Color|#FF0000|'''Jingle Cat Bell'''}} returns to The Battle Cats! Visit the {{Color|#FF0000|'''Legend Stages'''}} to save the holidays from {{Color|#FF0000|'''Dark Emperor Santa'''}} and his no-good elves of mischief.<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''Available December 1st (11:00am) thru December 31st (11:59pm)!'''}}

Get a chance to unlock {{Color|#0000FF|'''Reindeer Fish Cat'''}} upon clearing any event stage! Your chances will increase greatly if you play later, more difficult stages! (Or get a {{Color|#FF0000|100%}} chance to collect rewards by using the {{Color|#FF0000|Treasure Radar item}}!)

※ After you have picked up Reindeer Fish Cat, unlock it at the {{Color|#008F03|Rare Cats}} section of the Upgrade menu. If you have collected Reindeer Fish Cat from a previous event, it cannot be collected again.

